{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しお久しぶりです！\n間が空いちゃってごめんね😿"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41stシングル\n「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」\n無事発売を迎えました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、3曲参加させて頂いています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobf6wZak.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「君ばかり」\nhttps://youtu.be/zrVg31LSLio"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きなお二人がMVにも出演してくださってます😭\n今だに夢見たいな出来事、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "聴いているとどこか懐かしくなるような楽曲です\n大切な人を思い浮かべながら聴いてほしいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mob1Ho7w7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobItBZIe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」\nhttps://youtu.be/GuKqBjTvTCw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、　「年齢の境界線」という\nユニット曲をいただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobFZPfJK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはCDTV ライブ！ライブ！さん\nフルサイズで披露した時の〜🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "階段ショットお気に入り"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "既に様々な番組で披露させて頂いてますね〜\n披露するたびに新しい感情が芽生えています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早く皆さんの前でも披露したいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢お知らせ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・月刊GoodsPress\n冨里奈央ちゃんの連載、五百城茉央ちゃん小川彩ちゃんとシングルについてお話してます🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・BOMB 5月号\n表紙・巻頭を務めさせて頂いてます！\n大雨だった〜！笑\n雨の撮影も素敵でした☂️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・角川映画50周年・角川映画祭開催記念 「時をかける少女4Kデジタル修復版」特別上映会\nゲストとして小川彩ちゃんと出演します！\n重大発表、楽しみにしててね〜🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・4/18  23時30分〜\n日本テレビ系「サクサクヒムヒム ☆推しの降る夜☆ 『名探偵コナンSP－』」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・5/2  21時〜\nフジテレビ系「逃走中」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日から音楽番組が続くよ〜！\n有難いです😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・本日！19時〜\nフジテレビ系「STAR」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・4/17  21時〜\nテレビ朝日系「ミュージックステーション」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・4/18  23時〜\nNHK総合「Venue101」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "18日には\nGirlsAward 2026 SPRING／SUMMER さんにも出演させて頂きます\nライブパフォーマンスはなんとトップバッターです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山、みつけてね🩷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobKIKUCu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きなお姉さんたちが撮ってくれた🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"},